'''Superboom TNT''' is a {{Rare}} item that can be placed down by the player in order to break [[Weak Wall]]s, marked by {{Item|Cracked Stone Bricks|link=}}. Upon using '''Superboom TNT''', the item is consumed.

== Obtaining ==
=== Purchase ===
'''Superboom TNT''' is sold for {{c|2,500}} by {{NPCSprite|Walter}} in the back of the {{zone|Gunpowder Mines}}, and by {{NPCSprite|Chunk}} for {{c|2,500}} in the {{zone|Crystal Hollows}}. {{NPCSprite|Ophelia}} sells Superboom TNT for {{c|3k}} at the {{zone|Catacombs Entrance}} or the {{zone|Dungeon Hub}}.

=== Mob Drops ===
'''Superboom TNT''' can also be obtained by killing [[Angry Archaeologist|Angry Archaeologists]], [[Lost Adventurer|Lost Adventurers]], [[Frozen Adventurer|Frozen Adventurers]], [[The Watcher#Floor 5|Boomers]] in the [[The Catacombs - Floor V|Floor 5]] [[Magical Map#Magical Map Locations|Blood Room]], and the final mob in a dungeons room.

